Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='secretask', at=datetime(2026, 9, 21, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='A secret is asked for in the Inbox, never in a chat; the tap is the write', body="⚠️ *A secret is asked for in the Inbox, never in a chat* (2026-09-21, chain `secretask`, `docs/SECRETASK-PLAN-2026-09-21.md`; a key pasted into a Claude session cannot be scrubbed from the server-side record). The secretary proposes `Act::Secret { name: Settable, why }` (a name from the settings page's closed list); the card's write-only field is sent in the tap body — THE TAP IS THE WRITE — to `settings::Writes`, and the value has no field in any type, so it is never in a proposal, transcript, outcome or log. A secret tap without a value, or a value on any other act, is refused. Nothing in a session ever needs a secret's VALUE, only its name — if a step seems to need one pasted here, the step is wrong.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-21 (chain secretask, docs/SECRETASK-PLAN-2026-09-21.md): a key pasted into a Claude session cannot be scrubbed from the server-side record.', supersedes=()))